{"id":"223508772f8e35c5","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-post-problem.md","title":"Post Problem","display":"df-post-problem — Post Problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-post-problem","aliases":["68-df-post-problem"],"display":"df-post-problem — Post Problem","depends_on":["[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","[[68-df-recursive-set]]","[[68-df-halting-set]]","[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§15 p.56 / PDF 65","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"not-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-post-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-post-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-post-problem — Post Problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§15 p.56 / PDF 65"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Recursive}\">\\(\\mathrm{Recursive}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7fc8baae87b873a3\" href=\"?note=7fc8baae87b873a3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-set\">68-df-recursive-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"eab12566d8ac44ad\" href=\"?note=eab12566d8ac44ad\" title=\"68-df-halting-set\">68-df-halting-set</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"7ed23faee951231d\" href=\"?note=7ed23faee951231d\" title=\"68-df-turing-reducibility\">68-df-turing-reducibility</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PostProblem}\">\\(\\mathrm{PostProblem}\\)</span> 为以下零元命题缩写。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PostProblem}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(A\\notin\\mathrm{Recursive}\\land\\neg(K\\le_T A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PostProblem}\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists A\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\;(A\\notin\\mathrm{Recursive}\\land\\neg(K\\le_T A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书问题是是否存在零度与完备 r.e. 度之外的 r.e. 度，归约必须是 Turing 归约。旧式只排除 many-one 完备，无法排除 Turing 完备但非 many-one 完备的集合。对应度版本见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3f4822140bfc0f9e\" href=\"?note=3f4822140bfc0f9e\" title=\"68-df-intermediate-degree\">68-df-intermediate-degree</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursive-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-halting-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-turing-reducibility","status":"resolved","id":"7ed23faee951231d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-turing-reducibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]，$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。$\\mathrm{PostProblem}$ 为以下零元命题缩写。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-set","status":"resolved","id":"7fc8baae87b873a3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RE}$ 见 [[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]，$\\mathrm{Recursive}$ 见 [[68-df-recursive-set]]，$K$ 见 [[68-df-halting-set]]，$\\le_T$ 见 [[68-df-turing-reducibility]]。$\\mathrm{PostProblem}$ 为以下零元命题缩写。","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-halting-set","status":"resolved","id":"eab12566d8ac44ad","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerp